# Self-hosted, subsetted woff2 files go here. Expected filenames (referenced
# by src/styles/app.css @font-face and BaseLayout.astro preload links):
#
#   instrument-serif-regular.woff2
#   instrument-serif-italic.woff2     ← preloaded
#   geist-regular.woff2               ← preloaded
#   geist-medium.woff2
#   geist-semibold.woff2
#   geist-mono-regular.woff2
#   geist-mono-medium.woff2
#
# Download: Instrument Serif from fonts.google.com, Geist + Geist Mono from
# vercel.com/font. Subset to Latin (covers en/it/es) with glyphhanger or
# fonttools `pyftsubset`. Until these exist the system fallbacks render.
